<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en"><head><link href="assets/tailwind.css" rel="stylesheet"/><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><title>Industry &amp; Workforce Use Cases | ZKTeco WFM</title><meta content="Explore the considerations that shape workforce data collection across different industries, workforce models and operating environments." name="description"/><link href="/assets/site-enhancements.css?v=keytitles-v126" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="assets/privacy.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="assets/layout-standard-v114.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://zktecowfm.com/use-cases" /></head><body class="zk-page"><Header /><main><section class="zk-hero"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-eyebrow">USE CASES</div><h1>Design the Workforce Edge Around the Work.</h1><p>Explore the considerations that shape workforce data collection across different industries, workforce models and operating environments.</p></div></section><section class="zk-section"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">WORKFORCE ENVIRONMENTS</div><h2>Different Workforces Need Different Collection.</h2><p>Match collection to the environment, employee workflow, labor data, authentication, connectivity and policy requirements.</p></div><div class="zk-grid-3"><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">INDUSTRY</div><h3>Manufacturing</h3><p>High-throughput punching, labor allocation, rugged environments, badge/biometric choice, job transfers and resilient connectivity.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">INDUSTRY</div><h3>Healthcare</h3><p>Distributed locations, complex schedules, employee identity, time &amp; labor controls, staffing considerations and 24/7 operations.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">INDUSTRY</div><h3>Distribution &amp; Warehousing</h3><p>High-volume shift changes, rugged operating areas, reliable connectivity, fast authentication and labor movement.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">INDUSTRY</div><h3>Retail &amp; Hospitality</h3><p>Multiple sites, changing workforces, shared devices, easy employee interaction and flexible credential strategies.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">WORKFORCE</div><h3>Field &amp; Distributed Workforces</h3><p>A mix of clocks, mobile, web or other approved collection methods depending on workforce location and operational requirements.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">TIME &amp; LABOR</div><h3>Complex Labor Environments</h3><p>Projects, departments, cost centers, worktags, positions, transfers and other labor dimensions that may need to be captured at the source.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="zk-section alt"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">DESIGN PRINCIPLE</div><h2>Start With the Workforce—not the Device.</h2><p>Start with the operating requirement. Then choose the collection method, authentication, integration and device that fit.</p></div><div class="zk-actions"><a class="zk-btn primary" href="contact">Discuss Your Use Case</a><a class="zk-btn secondary" href="thought-leadership">Explore Related Insights</a></div></div></section></main><Footer /><script is:inline src="assets/privacy.js"></script></body></html>